        # Middle: Table for displaying imported files (using our DropTableWidget subclass)
        # Column order:
        # 0: Delete ("X"), 1: FullPath (hidden), 2: 📋, 3: Filename, 4: Title, 5: Compat warning (>32), 6: MIDI type
